# Confirm and error windows

Never use `window.confirm`, `window.alert`, or a one-off modal for OK/Cancel.

Use `useConfirm()` from `@/components/ui/confirm-dialog`. `ConfirmProvider` already wraps the app.

```tsx
const confirm = useConfirm();

const ok = await confirm({
  title: "Remove the 500 counted on lot 08302026?",
  description: "It stops counting towards on hand.",
  confirmLabel: "OK",
  cancelLabel: "Cancel",
  tone: "danger",
});
if (!ok) return;
```

- `tone: "danger"` for irreversible actions (remove, delete).
- Errors that only need acknowledgement: `cancelLabel: false`.
